{"id": "DfUkXfAAA59", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "He drew the bow no king could string. Then she refused him.\nवह धनुष, कोई राजा चढ़ा न सका... कर्ण ने उसे खींच लिया। फिर... द्रौपदी ने उन्हें ठुकरा दिया।\n\nAt Draupadi's swayamvara, Karna strung the great bow and drew it to a circle, and she said: \"I will not choose a Suta.\" Then a young Brahmin hit the mark, and Karna could not beat him. It was Arjuna. Thirteen years before the war, in the dice hall, Karna's words earned him Arjuna's vow. (Mahabharata, Adi Parva 1.187-192; Sabha Parva 2.64-76)\n\nViewer note: this part touches the dice hall and the insult to Draupadi. We show it as the text tells it, without showing the act.\n\nThe Brother Who Never Knew, Part 3. Part 4, The World Conqueror, is next.\n\nWho was right in the hall? Tell me below 👇\n\n#mahabharat #mahabharata #karna #draupadi #arjuna #महाभारत", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1793799083, "like_count": 636, "comment_count": 23, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-17959111065037522a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.767, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNGLzpgWNeWBbTKw4oOQ1dULlbolUniZGnFIXPAWmPOvflfYcukGWFMuME__B8hq96nuVe1nKFLEfRL4eP7bmMKbi5rwUKWGpOrDGA.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdrsvXDvelIVaVmDQTwqP7rpFYtVgX9GZ-JjlQsIrP5fIwcjvEl9LUISNWTqX7ArTvrekuiEyOYMgQZ3oQtT_2ZP&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=c5_gUW-w8BYQ7kNvwHn3sub&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=LzMwCFTWxuryyLpVHJ